# Herdr's generated typings for the mods' editor support. gpui-shell rewrites this file on every
# run, in every mod folder, from the runtime that runs the mod; a committed copy can only go stale.
# Nothing loads it at run time. See "Editor support" in DESK.md.
gpui-kit.d.ts
# The Fleet panel's settings live in Herdr's folder, never in the repo (mods/fleet/README.md).
mods/fleet/settings.json
